		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Misty, black-scaled drake. Judge and arbiter of death, determines where souls go.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d6) or ice breath, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Ice Breath</strong>. Fills a near-sized cube extending from yamaraj. DEX 15+ or 4d6 damage and frozen for 1 round.</p><p></p><p><strong>Magical Being</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to cold, healed by electricity.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
